1
00:00:03,298 --> 00:00:06,739
Chapter 12.

2
00:00:08,699 --> 00:00:13,619
The next planet was inhabited by a tippler.

3
00:00:13,619 --> 00:00:20,659
This was a very short visit, but it plunged a little prince into deep dejection.

4
00:00:21,539 --> 00:00:23,519
"What are you doing there?"

5
00:00:23,519 --> 00:00:27,838
he said to the tippler, whom he found settled down in silence before a

6
00:00:27,838 --> 00:00:34,400
collection of empty bottles and also a collection of fall bottles.

7
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:44,818
"I am drinking reply to the tipler with a lugubrious hair Why are you drinking?"

8
00:00:44,818 --> 00:00:48,139
demanded the little prince.

9
00:00:48,239 --> 00:00:53,760
"So that I may forget," replied the tippler.

10
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:55,380
"Forget what?"

11
00:00:55,380 --> 00:01:01,039
inquired the little prince, who already was sorry for him.

12
00:01:01,318 --> 00:01:09,019
"Forget that I am ashamed," the tipler confessed, hanging his head.

13
00:01:09,019 --> 00:01:16,280
"Ashamed of what?" insisted the little prince, who wanted to help him.

14
00:01:17,119 --> 00:01:20,579
"Ashamed of drinking!"

15
00:01:20,579 --> 00:01:29,298
The tiplo brought his speech to an end, and shut himself up in an impregnable silence.

16
00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:34,940
And the little prince went away, puzzled

17
00:01:35,780 --> 00:01:50,239
grown-ups are certainly very, very odd," he said to himself, as he continued on his journey
